  "forked_at": "2026-04-20",
  "description": "FASB us-gaap metamodel classification vocabulary — 24 orthogonal trait axes (elementsOfFinancialStatements, liquidity, activityType, operatingNonoperating, recordedValue, realizationStatus, hedging, leaseType, …) covering 95 classification members, plus the flowClassification axis (inflow/outflow/accrual/contra) derived from FASB's instant-* arcroles. Each member is a (category, identifier) pair modeled as a Classification node; element assignments live in rs-gaap-to-metamodel/v1/.",
